WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:05.046
It's a spectacle that's hard to believe.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:08.758
Standing before us is Sea Emperor Kaku,

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.302
a master that represents China.

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:15.098
It's a miracle that he's participating.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.268
It's a miracle that he's even standing.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.770
It's hard to believe he's fighting!

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.358
Begin!

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:32.657
It has begun! Sea Emperor versus Sea King!

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:35.326
This fight would normally

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:40.373
be a clear victory
for the higher-ranked Sea Emperor Kaku.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.375
However!

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:45.295
The age gap is a whopping 121 years!

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:49.257
Sea King Samwan is 25 years old.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.301
At this age, he's full of promise.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:56.056
I have heard that Samwan's master,
Ryusho So,

00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:58.266
went to Thailand 18 years ago.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:02.937
His daily wages came from
winning cash in Muay Thai matches.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:10.445
He witnessed a young Samwan
playing around with a cobra,

00:01:11.196 --> 00:01:13.073
and that was the historic moment

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:16.034
when Chinese Kenpo
and Muay Thai met by chance.

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:20.038
Then he got lessons for ten years.

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:23.166
They both moved to Hong Kong.

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:27.712
He won all his Raitai matches.

00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:30.924
A couple years ago,
the Chinese Ministry of Martial Arts

00:01:31.007 --> 00:01:35.595
finally gave the title of Sea King
to Samwan of Thailand.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:39.599
Look at that!

00:01:39.682 --> 00:01:41.559
He moved forward before we realized it.

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:45.063
Sea Emperor Kaku still has his glasses on.

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:48.066
It's not real.

00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:53.947
Life force, breathing, fa jin...

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.950
It's all make-believe.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:02.080
You call it martial arts, but it's all
just physical ability.

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:06.584
It's a world where you use
your body logically.

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:10.088
There's no magic there.

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:11.714
Faster...

00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:13.258
Faster...

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:14.759
Faster!

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.680
And, with more speed.

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:40.618
Flick!

00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:51.212
It's over!

